    ('Ornate picture frames', 'Look for decorative frames with carved details, gold leaf, or intricate patterns—shoot them up close to capture the craftsmanship and texture.', 'Locate frames with decorative carved, molded, or ornamental details. Show frame border with artistic embellishments and interior opening.', 'common'::public.item_rarity, 'Gold leaf on antique frames was applied directly to adhesive or gesso, making the genuine layer only micrometers thick but visible for centuries.', 'https://cejsntpvctcgezrluvql.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/collection-item-images/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/wiki-cache/9f4f6f020b4e7df0.jpg', 9),
